"Validate EPIC-14 Spec Kit (docs/features/epic-14-spec-kit.md, US-1401 to US-1407) as unvalidated raw input, Ideation phase only: Intent Capture, Feasibility and Constraints, Scope Definition, Approval and Handoff. Skip Market Research, Team Formation and Rough Mockups unless a critical gap needs them. Extract the underlying problem statement, check technical and architectural feasibility against the current codebase and stack, find missing requirements or conflicts, and sort the stories into MVP and out of scope. Stop at the Ideation to Inception verification gate; do not go into Inception or Construction."
